        <img src="https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kQs6keheMwCxJxrzV83VUwFtHkB.jpg"
             alt="Póster de Anatomy of a Fall" class="modal-cineura-poster" />
        <div class="modal-cineura-info">
            <h2>Anatomy of a Fall</h2>
